OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain will
OL,6,Fspread across the country throughout
OL,7,Fthe evening and night, turning heavy
OL,8,Fand persistent in places. Turning
OL,9,Fdrier and clearer in the northwest
OL,10,Ftowards dawn. Breezy, especially along
OL,11,Fnorthern and western coasts.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FOvernight rain clearing east
OL,14,Fduring the morning, with brighter
OL,15,Fskies following. A scattering of
OL,16,Fshowers then moving in for the
OL,17,Fafternoon, some of which maybe heavy.
OL,18,FBreezy and feeling cooler.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
